      "text": "1. Clarify\n\n2. Define Good Numerically\n\n3. Define each component which need to be measured\n\n4. Define Measurement for Each Component\n\n5. Design Ground Truth\n\n6. Design Release Gate\n\n7. Design Roll Out\n\n8. Design the Feedback Loop",
