      "text": "1. Tenant ID Exist\n2. Customer is part of that tenant\n3. Authentication is Valid\n4. Requested Resources are part of the tenant\n5. Cross Tenant Access is blocked \n6. Correct Tenant Specfic Tools and Indexes are loaded.",
